                    <TablixCell>
                      <CellContents>
                        <Textbox Name="Textbox6">
                          <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
                          <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
                          <Paragraphs>
                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>The offer hereby made is open for acceptance within thirty (30) days from the date of this letter and if not accepted unconditionally within that period, it will be deemed to be withdrawn. The Society reserves the right (in its sole discretion) to periodically review the Facility and without prior notice and at any time, revise, withdraw, modify or cancel, in whole or in part, the same whereupon any monies owing under or in respect of the Facility shall become due and repayable by you. This letter and/or the granting of the Facility may be withdrawn if, in the opinion of the Society, there is a material adverse change in relation to your financial position and/or business performance. All transactions arising from the operation of the Facility or the provision by the Society of other services will be subject to the schedule of fees detailed in the Society’s published tariff as may be amended by the Society from time to time. The Facility or any part thereof may be recalled by the Society by written notice to that effect, payable either upon demand or within a period stated in the notice.</Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                                    <FontSize>11pt</FontSize>
                                    <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                              </TextRuns>
                              <Style />
                            </Paragraph>
                          </Paragraphs>
                          <rd:DefaultName>Textbox6</rd:DefaultName>
                          <Style>
                            <Border>
                              <Color>LightGrey</Color>
                              <Style>Solid</Style>
                            </Border>
                            <PaddingLeft>2pt</PaddingLeft>
                            <PaddingRight>2pt</PaddingRight>
                            <PaddingTop>2pt</PaddingTop>
                            <PaddingBottom>2pt</PaddingBottom>
                          </Style>
                        </Textbox>
                      </CellContents>
                    </TablixCell>
                  </TablixCells>
                </TablixRow>
                <TablixRow>
                  <Height>2.505cm</Height>
                  <TablixCells>
