                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>and how you manage accounts to licensed credit reference bureaus for use in credit assessments or to prevent or detect fraud, as well as with people who provide a service to the Society or act as the Society’s agents, anyone that the Society transfers or may transfer rights to or duties and any person designated to be given such information pursuant to a valid court</Value>
