                      <CellContents>
                        <Textbox Name="Textbox45">
                          <CanGrow>true</CanGrow>
                          <KeepTogether>true</KeepTogether>
                          <Paragraphs>
                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>You represent and warrant to the Society from and after the date hereof, so that such representation and warranties shall be deemed to be repeated at all times as long as any sums shall remain actually or contingently owing to the Society that your execution of this letter, security documents and to any other document you may be required to execute in relation to the Facility and the performance of their terms are within your powers and have been duly authorized by all necessary actions and do not or will not contravene any law or any contractual or other restriction binding upon you and will not result in creation and or imposition of any encumbrance on your property, assets or revenues otherwise than as contemplated by this letter.</Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                                    <FontSize>11pt</FontSize>
                                    <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                              </TextRuns>
                              <Style />
                            </Paragraph>
                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>No consent or authorization (including spousal consent) has been obtained fraudulently or by coercion.</Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                                    <FontSize>11pt</FontSize>
                                    <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                              </TextRuns>
                              <Style>
                                <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
                                <LineHeight>12pt</LineHeight>
                              </Style>
                            </Paragraph>
                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>Any land or chattels offered as security is validly owned by you or if owned by a third party has been offered voluntarily and such third party has voluntarily offered to guarantee the Facility.

NOTE</Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                                    <FontSize>11pt</FontSize>
                                    <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value> THAT the Facility may be terminated at any time if the representations</Value>
                                  <Style>
                                    <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                                    <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                                    <FontSize>11pt</FontSize>
                                    <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                                    <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
                                    <Color>#000000</Color>
                                  </Style>
                                </TextRun>
                                <TextRun>
