                          <Paragraphs>
                            <Paragraph>
                              <TextRuns>
                                <TextRun>
                                  <Value>You may not assign or transfer all or any of your rights, benefits or obligations under or referred to herein without the Society’s prior written consent; which consent may be given at the Society’s sole discretion and on such conditions as the Society deems fit. The Society may at any time assign or transfer to any person all or any of its rights, benefits or obligations under or referred to in the Agreement or change its lending office.</Value>
